kalshi-trading-edge.skill
────────────────────────────────────────

## Description

Advanced Kalshi prediction market trading skill with edge detection, combining multiple data sources (FiveThirtyEight, ELO ratings, ESPN, line movement) to find profitable bets.

## Features

- Expected Value (EV) calculation
- Kelly Criterion position sizing
- FiveThirtyEight integration
- ELO rating system
- Line movement / sharp money detection
- Multi-sport support (NBA, NHL, MLB, Tennis, Soccer, NFL, WNBA)
- Portfolio correlation tracking
- Daily loss limits

## Usage

```python
from super_edge_bot import SuperEdgeBettingBot

bot = SuperEdgeBettingBot(min_ev=0.05)
asyncio.run(bot.run())
```

## Files

- `super_edge_bot.py` - Main bot combining all sources
- `edge_calculator.py` - EV math and Kelly sizing
- `fivethirtyeight_api.py` - 538 predictions
- `elo_rating_system.py` - ELO ratings
- `line_movement_tracker.py` - Sharp money detection
- `multi_sport_analyzer.py` - ESPN data
- `market_tracker.py` - Position tracking
- `daily_limits.py` - Risk management

